WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.514
CREW
Here we go. 3, 2, 1, Action!

00:00:03.564 --> 00:00:05.050
AWKWAFINA
Hold on, everybody!

00:00:06.204 --> 00:00:09.298
SIMU LIU
Shang-Chi is, at its core, a Marvel movie.

00:00:11.322 --> 00:00:17.279
That comes with a promise of action.
And a certain promise to the quality of

00:00:17.329 --> 00:00:19.690
the sequences that
we're about to deliver.

00:00:19.741 --> 00:00:20.982
KEVIN FEIGE
This film will take your breath away

00:00:21.032 --> 00:00:25.076
on the big screen. And it is as big as
anything that we've ever brought to life

00:00:25.126 --> 00:00:26.326
in the MCU before.

00:00:28.012 --> 00:00:29.147
ANDY CHENG
With the bus sequence,

00:00:29.197 --> 00:00:30.900
everything had to be perfect.

00:00:32.095 --> 00:00:34.656
DESTIN DANIEL CRETTON
That was something I've never done before.

00:00:34.706 --> 00:00:39.743
Taking a bus down San Francisco
hills and crashing into real cars.

00:00:40.298 --> 00:00:42.936
SIMU LIU
We are using literally every single inch

00:00:42.986 --> 00:00:45.982
of that bus and figuring out
what we can do with it.

00:00:47.019 --> 00:00:48.401
KATY
We make a good team!

00:00:49.988 --> 00:00:51.779
SIMU LIU
Some days I work out harder than others.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.618
AWKWAFINA
We're working with world class stunt teams.

00:00:54.668 --> 00:00:58.733
Their work ethic, everything that they're
doing is like, incredible to witness.

00:00:58.783 --> 00:01:00.936
FALA CHEN
I was training with the world champion

00:01:00.986 --> 00:01:03.852
of tai chi and
she was absolutely amazing.

00:01:04.853 --> 00:01:06.920
TONY LEUNG
I took two weeks to rehearse

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:10.447
our fight sequence. It's a symbol of
the aggressiveness and

00:01:10.498 --> 00:01:12.388
anger of the character.

00:01:12.921 --> 00:01:13.983
SIMU LIU
We're going to incorporate a lot of

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:17.686
different styles of martial arts.
Tai chi, which is very, very flowy.

00:01:17.736 --> 00:01:21.670
Another one is Wing Chun which is a bit
more combative. And then looking at

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:26.647
certain regional styles to kind of fill in
this mosaic of how this character moves.

00:01:31.553 --> 00:01:33.708
MICHELLE YEOH
This film should stand out on its own.

00:01:34.911 --> 00:01:39.716
It's got a very magical story behind it,
mixed with a lot of action.

00:01:42.443 --> 00:01:44.443
SIMU LIU
The world has no idea what they're up for.

00:01:44.493 --> 00:01:46.739
WENWU
It's time for you to take your place

00:01:46.789 --> 00:01:48.035
by my side.

00:01:48.086 --> 00:01:49.462
SHANG-CHI
That's not going to happen.

